  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.makeship.com%252fpetitions%252fstarbuncle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/401955/description_4f86516e-9fb9-4e50-90ae-1d64622f1552.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"160\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/401955/description_6f6e55e4-d1c2-4e5c-8eee-356da3fda062.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"155\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Ars Nouveau 是一個受 Ars Magicka 啟發的魔法模組，讓玩家可以自訂法術、製作魔法物品、進行儀式等等。完整文件由 Patchouli 在遊戲內提供。要開始使用此模組，請使用一本書和 1 個青金石製作「舊筆記本」。您也可以參考下方的 Wiki。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.arsnouveau.wiki%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>https://www.arsnouveau.wiki/</strong></span></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>引入自訂法術製作——隨時隨地打造符合你需求的法術！</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>製作強大的新飾品與小物件。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>驅動魔法機器。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>用可愛的魔法僕從自動化你的基地！</strong></span></li>\n</ul><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:24px\"><strong>正在尋找整合包？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>試試 Arcane Isles！一個以 Ars Nouveau 與 Hex Casting 為主的空島生存包。</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/arcane-isles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/arcane-isles</a></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>加入社群！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>加入 Discord 尋求協助或與其他巫師交流！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://discord.gg/y7TMXZu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>https://discord.gg/y7TMXZu</strong></span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/y7TMXZu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/743298050222587978/widget.png?style=banner2\" width=\"300\" height=\"160\"></a></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:24px\">支持模組</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>若要支持此模組，請造訪我們的 Redbubble 商店選購 Ars Nouveau 周邊商品！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.redbubble.com%252fpeople%252fGootastic%252fshop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>https://www.redbubble.com/people/Gootastic/shop</strong></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><strong>你也可以透過 Patreon 支持我們！我們的 Patreon 回饋等級包含 Discord 辨識角色，以及提交個人創意以新增至地牢戰利品中的新法術書的權利！在訂閱期間還可獲得部分周邊商品！Patreon 會員還可獲得 Discord 私人伺服器的存取權限。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/arsnouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/arsnouveau</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>依賴模組</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Curios</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Patchouli</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Geckolib 3.0（適用於 Minecraft 1.16.0 以上版本）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Geckolib 2.0（適用於任何 1.15 之後、1.16.0 之前的 Minecraft 版本）</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>Terrablender（選擇性依賴，用於啟用 Minecraft 1.19 以上版本的 Archwood Forest 生態域）</strong></span></li>\n</ul><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>法術製作</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>隨時隨地自訂你的法術！</strong></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lgQ3x4-FWFw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>儀式</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>施放強大的持續法術，影響整個區域！</strong></span><br><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IG-lTfAPVCQ?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>魔法助手</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><br></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>召喚各種魔法生物協助自動化！</strong></span></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Z1IT__CtCQs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>製作與附魔物品</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>製作強大物品或附魔你的裝備！<br></strong></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rcnhISDnlZ8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>焦點介紹與遊戲實況</strong></span></p><p><strong style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EPlrqmtnTuk?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">正在尋找擴充模組？</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Creo 由 Ars Nouveau 團隊製作——</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">為法術塔、原始本源罐等加入 Create 模組相容性！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-creo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-creo</span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Too Many Glyphs 由 DerringerCubed 製作——</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">新增多種符文，包括篩選器、特殊形態，以及獨特的目標鎖定/法術操作符文。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/too-many-glyphs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/too-many-glyphs</a> </span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars EnderStorage 由 MoonWolf 製作——</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">連接 Ars Nouveau 與 EnderStorage，讓你隨處存取 EnderStorage，可破壞與放置方塊至你的儲物箱，並顯示數值魔力。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-enderstorage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-enderstorage</a> </span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Elemental 由 Alexthw 製作——</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">為風、地、火、水四大學派新增 4 個新的法術核心，以及一個扭曲版本的召喚核心，將你的召喚物變得更陰森。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"> <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental-elemental-spell-foci\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elemental-elemental-spell-foci</a> </span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Scalaes 由 Alexthw 製作——</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">新增數個跨模組相容功能，包括與 Pekhui、ProjectMMO、Scaling Health 的整合。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-scalaes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-scalaes</span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Arsenal 由 ToxicMintTea 製作——</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">擴充護甲選項，包括元素使長袍與板甲，可提供折扣、增強效果，以及獨特的隱藏增益。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-arsenal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-arsenal</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Tome of Blood 由 ToxicMintTea 製作——</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">與 Ars Nouveau 和 Blood Magic 整合，提供特殊符文及消耗 LP 的物品與法術！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tome-of-blood\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tome-of-blood</span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Instrumentum 由 Sarenor 製作——</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">一系列提升生活品質的物品與配方，用於儲存/複製星兔、中繼器、更換裝備等！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-instrumentum\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-instrumentum</span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Ars Omega 由 dkmk100_ludum_dare 製作——</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">大幅擴展 Ars Nouveau 的力量上限，新增強大的符文、方塊、儀式、維度等內容。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-omega\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-omega</span></strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Zettai Ars 由 ZettaSword 製作——</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">一個整合 Ars Nouveau、Mana and Artifice 和 PlayerEx 的跨界模組！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zettai-ars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zettai-ars</span></strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KqNBPc.mp4\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>正在尋找其他模組嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>來看看 BlockPrints！這是一個結構藍圖分享和下載平台：<span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-prints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-prints</a></span></strong></span></p>",
